From fe5ea79085cd4bef86007f8c5e2f80710b7754fc Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Mikael Hug <mikaelhug@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 28 Oct 2026 11:51:17 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] Merge bande-hw/wifi into bande-hw/staging


---
 .../broadcom/brcm80211/brcmfmac/Makefile      |   4 +-
